%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: PayingSympathy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _sameOptionTarget: 1
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hmm, I guess that's a topic I'd rather delve into another day.
      Right now I need her guaranteed agreement to my proposal.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It would be quite disadvantageous to have her too distressed to
      give me a chance. At least, for now.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If it comforts you at all, I don't believe your defects are your
      fault.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's simply what the world had planned for you. You would've had
      no other decision other than to be as pathetic as you are now.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: A shame, really, but what can you do? Life is quite cruel, but
      we all have to manage one way or another.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I know I have. It's only a matter of time before you accept it
      and do so as well.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0cbf25f7256b5034e9498573542f4e76, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f029f114187d16c46b68146e4a2ca0fb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 I guess you're right."
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "I mean\u2026 fuck, I didn't get to choose any of this shit. I
      didn't get to choose to be this way!!!"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "It's this STUPID FUCKING WORLD!!!! THEY made me this way, it's
      all THEIR fault, it's all\u2026 aghhh FUCK THEM!!!"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm sorry that you've been dealt such a bad hand. It's pitiful,
      really.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But this is where I can come in. My deal is perfectly tailored
      to suit your needs and capabilities, unlike the world that you weren't made
      for.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I can help you realize your true purpose.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 264ba0fd55f3f0d40aa0a3d014011923, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "\u2026 thanks, I guess???"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f029f114187d16c46b68146e4a2ca0fb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I suppose that's a good thing...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "I dunno, I guess I'm just\u2026 it feels good to be understood
      like this?"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 264ba0fd55f3f0d40aa0a3d014011923, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Just feels like usually people just\u2026 brush me aside and
      think I'm some weird chick. They talk to me, but they don't talk to\u2026 ME,
      you know?"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "They just decide that 'cuz they don't like me I'm not worth their
      time. Isn't that just\u2026 terrible??"
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Not really.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If I wasn't here to get some business done, I honestly would've
      done the same. But this is a special case.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: But if the problem is just the world, how the hell am I supposed
      to even fix that??
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "I'm literally just one person\u2014why do I have to deal with
      the world if it wants to shit on me????"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's not fair!!! Things shouldn't be this way!!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hmm, I beg to differ.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: What?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Despite how poorly the world has treated you, everything is actually
      perfectly in order that way.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If there's anything wrong with the world, it's certainly not the
      structure.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's a flawless design that gives everyone a part to play; even
      the most useless of people can contribute something to society by just staying
      in their lane.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'Though, I''m getting ahead of myself. '
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Before I get into any of that, I'm curious...what specific circumstances
      have led you down this path?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Huh? What does that mean?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'd like to understand a little more about your general background.
      The history informs the person, no?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Uh-huh\u2014and why would you want to know that???"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'You said it yourself: you didn''t choose this for yourself, the
      world did. But what exactly did the world choose for you?'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Okay, look, that's enough. I get it, the world sucks or whatever,
      but I'm not telling you any more than I already have, alright?!
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You've played enough detective for one night. I'm not giving you
      anything else. Take it or leave it.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Looks like I'll have to risk upsetting her if I want to pry any
      further. Oh well.
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Force it out of her
  - _choiceType: 1
    _optionText: Be subtle about it
  _npcReplies:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49ac67e3b50c7e849a8543b56b43b15c, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7c0c35f315b94d428844f9d90f09321, type: 2}
  _gameEnd: 0
